&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://medium.com/swlh/all-about-auto-start-foreground-service-in-android-8bba7569123e&#34;
  
   target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34; &gt;
